  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>,</mo></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math>Variance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>11</mn></msubsup><msubsup><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>11</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mn>11</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>11</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>